# Level 7 (planet 7): the pod, shield on, is set down beside each kind of object the level adds
# (warp = a test setup: the pod at rest at X, Y and the camera at CX, CY, with the object just off
# screen so that it spawns), turns to face it, shoots (or not) and waits; the fuel is refilled and the pod
# set down again every 100 steps. The formation of six parts 23-2D, the satellite 60 with its companion
# 61, the large machine 22, wide machines 1D and 1C, the green creatures 43-46, the domes and the
# hourglass turrets, with their shots, missiles, drones and exhaust.
level 7
dc 80
3 -
1 D
2 -
